              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi umusi ukurikira amasabato indwi muzowugire mukuru, ari wo w’intangamarara wo kugenya ingano; muhimbaze n’umusi mukuru w’iyimbura wo ku mpera y’umwaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.34.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.34.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
