            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ntimuze munshikanire amaraso y’ibimazi ari kumwe n’ikindi kintu ico ari co cose kirimwo umwambiro, kandi ntimuzoreke ikintu na kimwe cashikanywe kuri Pasika ngo kirare gishike mu gitondo.",
          "type": "text",
